AegisZ (prototype). A zero-knowledge AI gateway for clinical and public-welfare records: it strips and tokenises personal data before any model sees it, adds calibrated noise, and records every decision in a tamper-evident, post-quantum-signed ledger.
Data Note: Synthetic records only.
Stack: {"Backend":["Python 3.11","FastAPI","ONNX Runtime"],"Security":["HMAC-SHA3-256","Laplace DP","ML-DSA-65","ML-KEM-768","CycloneDX"],"Frontend":["React","Tailwind","WebSockets"],"Ops":["Docker","multi-arch images","pytest"]}

Inferyx (prototype). An AutoML studio that keeps going after training: it profiles and repairs data, trains with live telemetry, explains the winner, watches for drift, and exports signed models.
Data Note: [[PLACEHOLDER: which datasets were used for the demo and benchmarks]]
Stack: {"Backend":["Python 3.11","FastAPI","Celery","Redis","SQLAlchemy"],"Data and ML":["Polars","PyArrow","scikit-learn","LightGBM","XGBoost","Optuna","SHAP","ONNX","Safetensors"],"Frontend":["React 19","esbuild","Vitest"],"Ops":["Docker","Docker Compose"]}

OrgMind (prototype). A company knowledge graph with an agent on top. Every answer cites a source that exists in the graph and that the asker is allowed to see.
Data Note: A synthetic company ("Northwind Labs"), labelled as synthetic throughout the UI.
Stack: {"Backend":["Python 3.11+","FastAPI","SQLAlchemy","arq","Redis","PostgreSQL 16","FalkorDB","LiteLLM"],"Frontend":["Next.js 14","React 18","TypeScript","Tailwind","Cytoscape.js"],"Quality":["pytest (48 tests)","Ruff","Mypy","pre-commit"],"Ops":["Docker Compose"]}

phenom (prototype). A local-first personal assistant: Flask and PyQt5 front ends over a local model served by Ollama, with a memory layer and a set of small service modules.
Data Note: An experiment in how far one assistant can stretch; the repository has about ninety flat files covering assistant, tracking and home-automation ideas.
Stack: {"Interfaces":["PyQt5","Flask"],"Local AI":["Ollama","Local LLM"],"Storage":["SQLite","JSON flat files"]}

RoadSaarthi (prototype). A prototype road-condition platform: it generates road-sensor events, scores each road segment, clusters hotspots spatially, and shows them on a live map with work orders.
Data Note: An independent prototype. It is not an official product of any government body, and its data is synthetic.
Stack: {"Backend":["Python","FastAPI","SQLAlchemy 2","PostGIS"],"ML":["scikit-learn (DBSCAN)"],"Frontend":["React 18","TypeScript","Vite","Tailwind","MapLibre GL","ApexCharts"]}

AI Threat Detection System (prototype). A network-traffic anomaly detector that scores flows with an Isolation Forest, assigns a severity, and raises alerts on a live dashboard.
Data Note: Trained and evaluated on synthetic traffic (85% normal, 15% injected port scans, DDoS, exfiltration and brute force).
